

## Overview

The agent runs as a continuous loop with three distinct modes:

| Mode | Trigger | Purpose |
|------|---------|---------|
| **Ingest** | Daily cron / manual | Read new content from feeds, extract technique patterns |
| **Index** | After ingest | Store structured techniques to knowledge base |
| **Apply** | Active test session | Query KB against target fingerprint, surface relevant techniques |

