## Prompt Chain — Step by Step

### Step 1 · Content Fetch Agent

**Role:** Pulls raw content from sources daily.

**System prompt:**
```
You are a security research feed aggregator. Your job is to fetch and
clean content from the following sources. For each item return:
- source_url
- title
- published_date
- raw_text (cleaned, no HTML)
- content_type: one of [writeup, cve_advisory, blog_post, talk_transcript, repo_commit]

Do not summarize. Return raw cleaned text only. Flag items published
in the last 48 hours as is_new: true.
```

**Feed list to configure:**
```yaml
rss_feeds:
  - https://portswigger.net/research/rss
  - https://feeds.feedburner.com/Exploitdb
  - https://blog.orange.tw/feeds/posts/default
  - https://blog.assetnote.io/feed.xml
  - https://labs.detectify.com/feed/
  - https://msrc.microsoft.com/blog/feed

github_watch:
  - swisskyrepo/PayloadsAllTheThings        # watch: new commits to /Web*
  - projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates       # watch: new .yaml files
  - carlospolop/hacktricks                  # watch: new .md files
  - danielmiessler/SecLists                 # watch: new wordlists

nvd_filter:
  cpe_keywords:
    - microsoft:asp.net
    - microsoft:iis
    - microsoft:.net_framework
  severity: [HIGH, CRITICAL]
```

