## Daily Cron Schedule

```
06:00  → Step 1: Fetch all feeds (RSS, GitHub, NVD)
06:30  → Step 2: Run Technique Extractor on new items
07:00  → Step 3: Dedup filter + store to KB
07:15  → Summary digest email/Slack: "N new techniques added, M updates"

On demand (active test session):
  → Step 4: Build target fingerprint from recon output
  → Step 5: Query KB → get ranked technique list
  → [Manual testing]
  → Step 6: Format findings as reports
```

